 457+ 6496              // This routine must be called with alternate registers active
 458+ 6496              // input: None (NEXTREG_read: A = NextReg number)
 459+ 6496              // Output: A = 8k-page number currently fitted at MMU7 (NEXTREG_read: its value)
 460+ 6496              // Only AF and BC are modified. Atomic: an interrupt cannot fall between the
 461+ 6496              // select on $243B and the read on $253B, and the interrupt state is restored.
 462+ 6496              // The second "ld a,i" covers the NMOS Z80 quirk: if an interrupt is accepted
 463+ 6496              // right after "ld a,i", P/V reads 0 even with interrupts enabled.
 464+ 6496              // Nextreg_Read_Ei: tail shared with REG!, enables interrupts only if P/V=1.
